        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T00:08:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know we use \u0027Make\u0027 for so many things, but SkPath,SkM44, and SkMatrix have started dropping it and I think it tends to read better. \n\nWDYT about being static Rect::LTRB, XYWH, and WH?\n\nI would also be ok with keeping LTRB as the name for both the 4 float and the 2 float2 variations. Same for XYWH and TopLeftSize-\u003eXYWH, and Size(float2) -\u003e WH(float2). \n\nMakeTopLeftBotRight just eats up so much of the precious line space 😊",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "6a3590e3bbefcccf37325279c3f0844ed88b134a",
