      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T00:08:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I like separating the concept of empty vs. negative, and find SkRect::isEmpty() to be misleading in that regard.\n\nBesides this function, can we also provide isEmpty() and isNegative()?",
