        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T00:08:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In other code, we don\u0027t usually need the skvx:: for non-template functions to be found. Is that not the case here because we\u0027re inside skgpu::geom?\n\nIf we don\u0027t need it, let\u0027s remove as many as possible 😊",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 64,
        "startChar": 44,
