      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T17:41:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that gets a little tricky.\n\nWhat if w\u003d\u003d0 and h\u003c0? Do we count that as empty or negative?\n\nFor emptiness, and depending on their specific needs, I think it would be more clear for the caller to check:\n\n  any(rect.size() \u003d\u003d 0)\n  all(rect.size() \u003d\u003d 0)",
